{"id": "Dfd51WjCjFU", "title": "Video by vedastovikings", "description": "This armour made him unkillable. He cut it off, smiling.\nइस कवच के रहते कोई उसे मार नहीं सकता था... और उसने मुस्कुराते हुए उसे काट दिया।\n\nKarna was born in an armour no weapon could pierce. The Sun came to him in a dream: Indra will come as a Brahmin and beg for it; give it, and you will die. Karna would not refuse a Brahmin. At noon by the river, the king of the gods came. Karna knew him, asked for his Shakti, the spear that never misses (one enemy only, and never in anger, or it falls on him), and peeled the armour from his body, smiling, while the gods beat their drums and rained flowers. (Mahabharata, Vana Parva 3.298-308)\n\nThe Brother Who Never Knew, Part 6. Part 7, A Sixteenth Part: he meets Arjuna at last.\n\nWould you have given it? Tell me below 👇\n\n#mahabharat #mahabharata #karna #indra #suryaputra #महाभारत", "channel": "vedastovikings", "uploader_id": "60997589521", "uploader": "Vedas to Vikings | Mythology films", "timestamp": 1794112338, "like_count": 4467, "comment_count": 21, "http_headers": {"User-Agent": "Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/146.0.0.0 Safari/537.36", "Accept": "text/html,application/xhtml+xml,application/xml;q=0.9,*/*;q=0.8", "Accept-Language": "en-us,en;q=0.5", "Sec-Fetch-Mode": "navigate", "Referer": "https://www.instagram.com/"}, "formats": [{"format_id": "dash-17960067393037522a", "ext": "m4a", "tbr": 65.114, "asr": 48000, "format_note": "DASH audio", "container": "m4a_dash", "vcodec": "none", "acodec": "mp4a.40.5", "url": "https://instagram.fblr22-2.fna.fbcdn.net/o1/v/t2/f2/m78/AQOKydpFMQoTd30uqcpJ85rF9FaDVaTMs1Tm02uBFdy6H1wwsH583auzQzf9YA63AD8eu448OnZYZOmpDhwRfchsRFkd0lfQYxAaEtc.mp4?_nc_cat=102&_nc_oc=AdqktHZwrQkYN9dyUSnohILt82Hhg6DDpn_xalqqrP_X3ElVO4SVxjHr34NaDouwd9dbX0ukReM66IZbJJe0uT8r&_nc_sid=9ca052&_nc_ht=instagram.fblr22-2.fna.fbcdn.net&_nc_ohc=RpE9a1NYczMQ7kNvwGyRiXq&%3D&ccb=17-1&_nc_gid=29c